    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The French Medical Institute for Children is now offering live teleconsultations in neurology to Bamyan Provincial Hospital (BPH) and Faizabad Provincial Hospital (FPH), in Kabul, Afghanistan. This new service links patients at BPH and FPH with a neurologist at FMIC. Ever since the launch of the services in June 2014, more than 60 patients have received expert diagnosis and treatment at both sites from FMIC",
